Package: rladybugdb
Title: R Interface to LadybugDB Embedded Graph Database
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raden Muhammad", "Hadi", email = "hadimaster65555@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Claude", role = "aut", comment = "Anthropic AI assistant"))
Description: Provides an R interface to LadybugDB, an embedded columnar graph
    database using the Cypher query language. LadybugDB is a fork of KuzuDB
    with the same query interface. This package uses native Rcpp bindings to
    the LadybugDB C library, requiring no Python runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
